Port 2222
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
HostKey /etc/chisa-sync/ssh_host_ed25519_key
AuthorizedKeysFile /etc/chisa-sync/authorized_keys
PermitRootLogin prohibit-password
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
UsePAM no
AllowUsers root
# The host API owns this read-only bind; its UID need not equal container root.
StrictModes no
AllowAgentForwarding no
X11Forwarding no
PermitUserRC no
AllowTcpForwarding yes
GatewayPorts clientspecified
PermitListen 0.0.0.0:*
PrintMotd no
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
LogLevel VERBOSE
